Source: cixtech/cix-linux-main commit
19f2947303670f2e5734d6a96ffc72a80fd9b942.

Released CIX firmware encodes some ACPI graph links as a device reference
followed by hierarchical data-node names.  Keep that compatibility rule out
of the generic property-reference parser: use it only after normal graph
resolution fails, only between present allowlisted CIX devices, and require a
reciprocal link before accepting either known malformed Type-C variant.

